# Scenario name
msgid "Rescue"
msgstr ""

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Rescue a research scientist from the Kraylor's clutches. Any number of "
"player ships supported.\n"
"\n"
"With the default settings, the scenario should run for 30 to 60 minutes. "
"Terrain changes each scenario run. Scenario difficulty: Low to medium with "
"default settings.\n"
"\n"
"Version 1\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's usually one every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr ""

